        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Addresses the dev-docs-needed requirement of <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1986688" rel="nofollow">Bug 1986688</a> Cookies are returned with a fractional expirationDate for the change made in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1972757" rel="nofollow">Bug 1972757</a> Store cookie expiry value as msec.</p>
